#org @gText_AnthraTown_PlayersPoster
It's an inspiring poster of Champion\nSelene winning her Champion match.

#org @gText_AnthraTown_NESClassic
[PLAYER] played the NES Classic for\na bit.\pOk! Time to get going.

#org @gText_AnthraTown_FlowerGirl
Aren't these flowers pretty? The\ngirl from the flower fields\lbrought them to me!

#org @gText_AnthraTown_TechnologyMan
Technology is incredible!\pYou can now modify the way the\nworld is designed and create\lyour own adventures!

#org @gText_AnthraTown_OldMan
Ah, [PLAYER]!\pI can't believe it is time for you\nto begin your Pok\emon journey.\pIt feels like you were just a\nbaby not too long ago.\pTime sure flies, hohoho!

#org @gText_AnthraTown_MomRestPrompt
Mom: [PLAYER]!\nYou should take a quick rest.

#org @gText_AnthraTown_MomPokemonAreHealthy
Oh, good! You and your\nPok\emon are looking great.\lTake care now!

#org @gText_AnthraTown_MomLeaveHome
[RED][RIVAL] was looking for you dear.\nDon't keep him waiting, okay?

#org @gText_AnthraTown_MomLeaveHomeAfterRunningShoes
[RED]Enjoy your journey with [RIVAL] and\nyour Pok\emon, and stay safe!\pAnd remember, you can always come\nhome, whenever you need to.

#org @gText_AnthraTown_RivalArrival
[RED][PLAYER], sweetie, please come\ndownstairs. [RIVAL] is here to see\lyou!

#org @gText_AnthraTown_MeetingRival
[BLUE][PLAYER], there you are! I was\nwondering if you were ever going to\lcome downstairs.\pYou know what today is, right?

#org @gText_AnthraTown_RivalRememberingToday
[BLUE]Of course you do! It's all we've\ntalked about for ages now.

#org @gText_AnthraTown_RivalNotRememberingToday
[BLUE]Whaaaat? We've been planning this for\nages! How could you forget?

#org @gText_AnthraTown_RivalExplainingChampionSeleneComing
[BLUE]Champion Selene is coming to Anthra\nTown today to do field research\lwith Professor Hawthorne!\pToday is our best chance to get\nher autograph. Can you believe our\lluck?\pI already talked to your mom, and\nyou're covered. Come on, let's\lgo! Last one there is a rotten\lTogepi!

#org @gText_AnthraTown_RivalPause
[BLUE]Oh!

#org @gText_AnthraTown_RivalThanksMom
[BLUE]Thanks again for breakfast, ma'am! It\nwas delicious.

#org @gText_AnthraTown_RivalUrgesPlayer
[BLUE]Hurry up, [PLAYER], we can't miss her!

#org @gText_AnthraTown_MomEncouragesPlayer
[RED][RIVAL] sure is in a hurry, isn't he?\nToday means a lot to him, you\lshouldn't keep him waiting.

#org @gText_AnthraTown_Gabby
[RED]We're here to interview Champion\nSelene. Please be patient with us.

#org @gText_AnthraTown_Ty
[BLUE]My camera kits opened up during the\ndrive. What a mess!

#org @gText_AnthraTown_FootprintGuy
[BLUE]Hey, I'm busy recording the\nfootprints of a Pok\emon that passed\lthrough here. Can you come back\llater?

#org @gText_AnthraTown_RivalMom
Oh, [PLAYER], what a pleasant\nsurprise! [RIVAL] was looking for\lyou earlier, did he find you? He\lsaid something about the Champion\land ran off.

#org @gText_AnthraTown_RivalMomBeingPersuaded
Well[.] I don't know, dear. It sounds\nlike it could be awfully dangerous.

#org @gText_AnthraTown_RivalPersuadingMom
[BLUE]Pleeeease, mom! I promise I'll be\ncareful. I'll call you every week\ltoo!

#org @gText_AnthraTown_RivalMomAfterJourneyStarts
I'm a little hesitant to let [RIVAL]\ngo on a Pok\emon journey, but I'm\lsure it'll be alright if you're with\lhim, [PLAYER].\pTake care of each other and have\nfun. And remember, you can always\lcome home.

#org @gText_AnthraTown_ConvincingPlayerMom
You want to depart on a Pok\emon\njourney?\pI assumed the day would come where\nyou would want to follow in your\lfather's footsteps[.]\pVery well, I'll allow it, but on one\ncondition.\pYou and [RIVAL] have to take care\nof each other. The world can be a\ldangerous place at times.

#org @gText_AnthraTown_ConvincingPlayerMom_PlayerDeclined
I'll give you time to think about it,\nbut that is my condition.

#org @gText_AnthraTown_MomGivesRunningShoes
Then you go with my\nblessing.\pBefore you go, make sure you take\nyour Running Shoes with you.

#org @gText_AnthraTown_MomGivesTownMap
[RED]Make sure you take this with you\ntoo, so you don't get lost.

#org @gText_AnthraTown_MomSendsPlayerOff
[RED]The road ahead will be long, but\nremember, you can always come\lhome.\pNow go, and make some wonderful\nmemories with [RIVAL]!

#org @gText_AnthraTown_RivalCanGoOnJourney
[BLUE]Hey [PLAYER], you'll never believe\nit.\pMy mom said I could go on a journey\nif I went with you!

#org @gText_AnthraTown_ReturnToSeleneAndHawthorne
[BLUE]Whaaaat? You too? Awesome!\pC'mon, let's go tell Miss Selene and\nthe Professor the good news!

#org @gText_AnthraTown_PlayersHouseMailbox
[PLAYER]'s House

#org @gText_AnthraTown_RivalsHouseMailbox
[RIVAL]'s House

#org @gText_AnthraTown_TownPlacardSign
Anthra Town\nThe town of infinite possibilities!

#org @gText_AnthraTown_RivalsBooks
The shelves are crammed full of\nbooks on Champion Selene.

#org @gText_AnthraTown_RivalsFamilyPicture
It's a picture of [RIVAL] and\nhis family. They look happy!

// Post Credits Party
#org @gText_AnthraTown_PostCredits_RivalCollectingPlayer
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]Hey, [PLAYER]!\pSorry it took so long for us to get\nready for your party[.]\pWe just didn't expect you to become\nthe Champion that quickly! Hahaha!\pC'mon! Everyone's waiting for you!

#org @gText_AnthraTown_PostCredits_RivalStartingParty
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]Alright, let's get this\nparty started.

#org @gText_AnthraTown_PostCredits_RivalCallsForEveryoneToGather
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]Hey, everyone, gather\nround! [PLAYER] is here!

#org @gText_AnthraTown_PostCredits_MomCongratulatesPlayer
[BLACK]Mom: [RED]Sweetie[.] I'm so proud of you.\pIt feels like it was only yesterday\nthat you were leaving home.\pAnd now[.] You're Kulure's newest\nChampion!

#org @gText_AnthraTown_PostCredits_OldManCongratulatesPlayer
[BLACK]Old Man: [BLUE]Hehehe[.]\pYou've come such a long ways in such\na short period of time.\pPlease, accept this old man's\ncongratulations.

#org @gText_AnthraTown_PostCredits_YoungsterCongratulatesPlayer
[BLACK]Youngster: [BLUE]Remember when I was\nlooking at Pok\emon footprints and\lwouldn't let you pass?\pHahaha! Who would've thought I was\ngetting in the way of the Champion\lin the making?

#org @gText_AnthraTown_PostCredits_RivalCongratulatesPlayer
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]Heh, lively bunch, eh?\p[PLAYER], I wanted to congratulate\nyou, too.\pI was glued to the TV the whole\ntime you were battling Selene.\pYou really gave it your all and\nshowed the world how tough you\lare!\pAnd now[.] You're the Champion!\nThat's incredible!

#org @gText_AnthraTown_PostCredits_AlistairArrives
[BLACK]???: [BLUE][PLAYER] is here, you say?

#org @gText_AnthraTown_PostCredits_RivalConfirmsAlistairsArrival
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]Alistair? What're you doing\nhere?

#org @gText_AnthraTown_PostCredits_AlistairAsksToBattle
[BLACK]Alistair: [BLUE]I heard that someone\ndefeated Selene in battle.\pI wasn't surprised at all to hear it\nwas you that did it, [PLAYER].\pYou and your Pok\emon have always\nheld a special bond.\pAnd, an unbreakable trust in each\nother to get through any hardship.\p[PLAYER], I've been spending a lot of\ntime reflecting since our encounter\lat Carnelidge Volcano.\pI[.] Want to understand my Pok\emon\nbetter. Like you do.\pPlease, if you are willing, would you\nbattle with me?\pI wish to see firsthand the type of\nbond that earned your victory.

#org @gText_AnthraTown_PostCredits_RivalAsksIfPlayerWantsToBattle
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]Your first challenger as\nthe new Champion[.]\pWhat do you say, [PLAYER]?

#org @gText_AnthraTown_PostCredits_RivalCommentsOnPlayerBattlingAlistair
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]Heh, I suppose I didn't\nneed to ask, did I?

#org @gText_AnthraTown_PostCredits_AlistairPreBattle
[BLACK]Alistair: [BLUE]Thank you, [PLAYER].\pPlease, show me the strength that\nyou and your Pok\emon earned your\ltitle with.

#org @gText_AnthraTown_PostCredits_AlistairWinsOrLoses
Phenomenal.\nTruly[.] Thank you, [PLAYER].

#org @gText_AnthraTown_PostCredits_AlistairLeaves
[BLACK]Alistair: [BLUE][PLAYER], thank you for\nbattling with me.\pYour rise to becoming the Champion\nwas no mistake.\pYou and your Pok\emon are truly\nsomething special.\pI understand better now.\pPok\emon are not tools[.]\pAnd, it doesn't matter if you win or\nlose your battles.\pBeing able to connect with Pok\emon is\nwhat matters most.\p[PLAYER], I must be going now.\nI have a lot of work to do.\pMay we meet again someday, after\nI've done what I need to do.

#org @gText_AnthraTown_PostCredits_RivalCommentsOnAlistairBattle
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]Nice battling, [PLAYER]!\pI think you really helped Alistair\nunderstand something.\pSomething he'd forgotten along the\nway[.]\pI'm sure he'll be alright now.\pNow, how about we keep this party\ngoing?

#org @gText_AnthraTown_PostCredits_NextSteps
Your journey to become the Champion\nhas concluded.\pHowever, there are many more stories\nto be told in the Kulure region!\pRevisit old locations to see how the\nregion has changed.

#org @gText_AnthraTown_PostCredits_PromptToSeeProfessorSakura
Perhaps Professor Sakura at the\nInterdimensional Research Facility\lknows something about this[.]

#org @gText_AnthraTown_ChampionFanatic_Intro
O-oh, Champion [PLAYER]!\nIt's really you!\pI'm a huuuuuge fan!\pI know everything about you and your\njourney.\pI-if you aren't too busy, I could\ntell you about some of the things\lI've seen you accomplish?

#org @gText_AnthraTown_ChampionFanatic_WantToKnowStats
What statistic would you like to know\nmore about? ([B_BUTTON] to cancel)

#org @gText_AnthraTown_ChampionFanatic_DoNotWantToKnowStats
O-okay! No worries! Ahaha[.]

#org @gText_AnthraTown_ChampionFanatic_AfterStatsChat
I'll keep track of everything you\nachieve.\pJust say the word and I'll share\neverything I know!

